{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1343.unity3d","item_key":"commands[4].text","source_sha256":"4371be4c806c18f01cad47d6b74a29ee8b41a49a307c37159e14bee741a78987","ja":"良い年末を！","zh":"祝你度过愉快的年末！","status":"accepted","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:16+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1343.unity3d","item_key":"commands[5].text","source_sha256":"8c0ffe1df7b238955ef21e6446b4d9b468e617561bead01ff07cd4c324c32f52","ja":"簡単なことさーっ！　だらしなくなっても、\n仕事始めまでに元に戻したら問題ないでしょ？","zh":"很简单的啦！就算变懒散了，\n只要在开工前恢复原样不就没问题了吗？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:59:02+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1343.unity3d","item_key":"commands[6].text","source_sha256":"7349c7836d92e7d81b0964251459a0cd7a03908071e2b48d2a5bcf07a3879f04","ja":"だから年末年始はゆっくり休んで、\nその後、いっぱいトレーニングしたらいいさー！","zh":"所以岁末年初就好好休息，\n之后再做大量的训练就好啦——！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:59:02+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1343.unity3d","item_key":"commands[7].text","source_sha256":"fd8d7b69e61cd590ca1ee4350ed5eaf66809a6ddb262b4f1a76a42caf3cb9a4e","ja":"そ、そっか……気持ちの切り替えにもなるし、\nよさそうだね……。","zh":"这、这样啊……正好能转换一下心情，\n感觉挺不错的呢……。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:59:02+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1343.unity3d","item_key":"commands[8].text","source_sha256":"4acb0b90f1383c5c0c9db64354cf3d2db4393629da06a590dd2cc66c3f062b42","ja":"そうだな、多少だらしなくなったって、\n仕事までに戻せばいいんだよな……。","zh":"也是啊，就算稍微有些邋遢，\n只要在工作前调整回来就行了嘛……","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:59:02+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1343.unity3d","item_key":"commands[9].text","source_sha256":"3c6f544f9fb348b9904f2ff7bad5e4214ea11383b63863bd9656fbf10ee121ee","ja":"よし！　アタシ、決めたよ！\n今年の年末年始は実家で羽を伸ばしてくる！","zh":"好！我已经决定了！\n今年年末年初我要回老家好好放松一下！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:59:02+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1343.unity3d","item_key":"commands[10].text","source_sha256":"e282c770b6260b622f7c6eee9431c8f71a2c03e890554ed164c7bf125f59b22c","ja":"体を休めて英気を養って……。\n帰ってきたらしっかりトレーニングするからさ！","zh":"好好休息，养精蓄锐……\n等回来之后，我一定会好好训练的！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:59:02+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1343.unity3d","item_key":"commands[11].text","source_sha256":"7f9e39625ca75d607659e34ef6e5f4cf970c50c3949026ef000d2aa6e3b9561d","ja":"それなら、自分も一緒にやっていい？\n一緒の方が、絶対に楽しいぞ！","zh":"要是那样的话，我也能一起做吗？\n一起的话，绝对更有意思哦！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:59:02+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1343.unity3d","item_key":"commands[12].text","source_sha256":"331804e7256d6b722f5f8cd632bb732412683a18f2eff07c65a0d5d9113a5d26","ja":"な、なら、私も……。","zh":"那、那样的话，我也……。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:59:02+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1343.unity3d","item_key":"commands[13].text","source_sha256":"063282d0493822137b344374d7a43327bd63635091906e6ec6bd1d309f23aac9","ja":"もちろん！　アタシもなんだかんだ、\n一緒の方が頑張れると思うしさ！","zh":"当然啦！我也觉得不管怎么说，\n还是在一起的时候更有干劲嘛！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:59:02+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1343.unity3d","item_key":"commands[14].text","source_sha256":"324a4fb16fa838d2ec0b5c208a5cc1d4774300ffcc8c9e1205d23c1c9a5d6fb9","ja":"えへへっ……楽しみだな……♪","zh":"嘿嘿……好期待啊……♪","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:59:02+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1343.unity3d","item_key":"commands[15].text","source_sha256":"fff48721d068c90e80bd590897f9da1c5eff6645e04bedb6acd751f0494abd94","ja":"それじゃあ自分は、ふたりのためにすごく激しい\nトレーニングを考えておくね！","zh":"那我来为你们两个想一套非常高强度的\n训练菜单吧！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:59:02+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1343.unity3d","item_key":"commands[16].text","source_sha256":"fb2e15df4420c61f8390dc17c31b140d4e7026b63386275797a97b9ebabdf743","ja":"な、なんか、\nすごいことになりそうな気がするけど……。","zh":"总、总觉得，\n好像会变成很不得了的事情……","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:59:02+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1343.unity3d","item_key":"commands[17].text","source_sha256":"0105e6b7314fb3b0b13e6b16514d49f4b390025a45f66b7fe1ea9d52f71939c4","ja":"でも望むところだ！　バッチリこなして見せるよっ！","zh":"不过正合我意！我会完美做给你看的！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:59:02+00:00"}
